# Conformance probe pack: an outer `when … as` key that the inner pack also
# maps (spec 0.34 ruling 8, with 0.30), most significant bit first. Public.
#
#   byte 0      a common when, 5 or 6, bound to x
#   the rest    one conformance-inner-fixed message (which maps x in 4 bits)
format     conformance-inner-askey
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
when    8  5,6  as probe.x
kind    only
inner   conformance-inner-fixed
